# Client data exports: real customer names, balances and supplier catalogues
# that land here when working with a client's books. This repo is public, and
# git history keeps whatever is committed even after the file is deleted, so
# these must never be added. Anchored to the repo root so the blank import
# templates the app ships under client/ are unaffected.
/*.xlsx
/*.xls
/*.csv
